// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
; specs/t27os/identity.t27 -- the identity fields of one agent letter, read from specs/agents/<l>.t27 by `use` (the truth),
; and the DRIFT GATE of specs/t27os/identity_table.t27 (the mirror the window imports): every cell is compared below
; Owner, 2026-10-20: the hero of a letter's page is the agent identity card widget: a huge outlined glyph, the agent NAME
; (Gamma), the DOMAIN as title, ARCHETYPE + REGISTER + LAYER, and the lists the sidebar sections show (SKILLS, TOOLS).
; One dispatcher per field over the 27 agent modules (the same shape as domain_pulse.t27 a_key_at); letter o is 1..27
; (27 = Ti); anything else is "" / 0. ASCII only (L3), English only (LANG-EN).

module T27osIdentity;

